Gobe Productive for Haiku (port) - preview build

PLACEHOLDER: the terms for this port haven't been decided yet. Until they
are, this preview is for testing only and comes with no warranty.

The port contains no part of the original Gobe Productive: it reads the
menus, dialogs, strings and pictures from your own copy of the original
program at runtime. Gobe Productive is a trademark of its owners.
